  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the forgotten depths of Subchain City, 'Hatch' earned his scars scavenging for scraps and DRIP. Abandoned as a hatchling, he quickly learned that survival meant being tougher and more resourceful than the other wasteland ducks.",
    "class": "Toxic Brawler",
    "name": "Hatch Hazard",
    "personality": "Gritty: Hatch doesn't sugarcoat anything. He's seen the worst of Subchain City, and it's left him with a cynical outlook.\nTough: Hatch is resilient and doesn't back down from a fight. He's always willing to put himself on the line for his flock.\nResourceful: Hatch can make the most out of almost anything. He's a scavenger at heart and knows how to find the DRIP.",
